Yesterday I was on the castle level, in the corridor by the back entrance 
(wearing my ring of levitation, since I'd just got in that way, and wanted to 
avoid the trapdoors). In one of the storage rooms was a purple worm who duly 
swallowed me. While I was bashing holes in his insides, he went over to one of 
the trapdoors - but didn't fall through - and as soon as I killed him (from 
the inside) the dungeon collapsed. Perhaps the 'monster swallows you and
falls through a trapdoor' code is buggy? Has anyone else experienced this?

-Marius


